<title>USA: Central Newspapers Oct revenues up 8.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Central Newspapers Oct revenues up 8.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS, Ind. 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Central Newspapers Inc said its revenues for the four weeks ended October 27 rose 8.2 percent to $50.6 million from $46.7 million in the same year-ago period.</p>
<p>Year to date, revenues gained 8.4 percent to $500.2 million from $461.6 million.</p>
<p>Central Newspapers is a media company that publishes daily, Sunday and weekly newspapers.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
